{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714130/extras/the-first-mine-steam-banner.jpg?t=1746527964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The First Mine</strong> is a relaxed turn based building, strategy and puzzle game. You need to run a productive gold mine with your population by placing, grouping and upgrading various resource tiles without being distracted by  random events.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a single player </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place, group and upgrade various tiles to collect resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run a productive mine with your population to mine gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't let  events distract you</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714130/extras/the-first-mine-steam-gameplay-1.jpg?t=1746527964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a relaxed game alone in single player mode. There are different  difficulty levels to choose from, as well as several characters with unique traits for varied gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each round you have to cleverly place and group a new random resource tile and upgrade your existing tiles as needed. Placing a new tile end the current round, mine gold in your mine and collect resources like wood, stone, wheat and fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714130/extras/the-first-mine-steam-gameplay-2.jpg?t=1746527964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To mine gold, you need people in your villages. To keep them, you need to provide enough wheat and fish each round. More people and a higher level increases the amount of gold produced per round. You need wood and stone to upgrade the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, there are random game events like trade, raids or natural disasters that can influence the game in a positive or negative way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714130/extras/the-first-mine-steam-gameplay-3.jpg?t=1746527964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What The First Mine Demo offers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix of strategy, building and puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn based, relaxed and calming gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Simple resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random game events like trade, raids or natural disasters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What The First Mine Demo does not offer:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4X strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Citizen simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced trading system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat and violence</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714130?t=1746527964","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714130/c62e1ccf45a422f5054adf68e8e003dfb5069838/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746527964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714130/f1526320867d4975eb60c07ec7ce395b2e4b3cd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746527964","capsule_imagev