g\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714130/extras/the-first-mine-steam-gameplay-2.jpg?t=1746527964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To mine gold, you need people in your villages. To keep them, you need to provide enough wheat and fish each round. More people and a higher level increases the amount of gold produced per round. You need wood and stone to upgrade the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, there are random game events like trade, raids or natural disasters that can influence the game in a positive or negative way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714130/extras/the-first-mine-steam-gameplay-3.jpg?t=1746527964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What The First Mine Demo offers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix of strategy, building and puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn based, relaxed and calming gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Simple resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random game events like trade, raids or natural disasters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What The First Mine Demo does not offer:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4X strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Citizen simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced trading system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat and violence</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Stefan B\u00f6ttcher"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2328840","name":"The First Mine"},"genres":[{"description"